      "title": "RBLBANK: Upcoming Governance Changes Will Support Future Re Rating",
      "body": "Analysts have adjusted their price target on RBL Bank from ₹410 to ₹390, citing updated assumptions around revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E multiples in their valuation work. What's in the News Board meeting on April 11, 2026 to consider an amendment agreement to the existing investment agreement with Emirates NBD Bank (P.J.S.C) and to consider convening an extra ordinary general meeting (company filing) Extraordinary general meeting scheduled for May 4, 2026 to seek shareholder approval for amendments to the Articles of Association and to grant a special right on director nomination to an identified shareholder (company filing) Special or extraordinary shareholders meeting on May 4, 2026 at 11:00 Indian Standard Time, aligning with the proposed changes to governance documents",
