      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-26T22:53:31.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹14.34 (vs ₹11.81 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹14.34 (up from ₹11.81 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹82.3b (up 13% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹8.79b (up 23% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 11% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 22% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 1.7% growth forecast for the Banks industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 18% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 26% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
