      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on RBL Bank slightly, with fair value moving from about ₹343 to around ₹338, reflecting updated assumptions on discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin, and future P/E. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for April 11, 2026, at 10:04 Indian Standard Time to consider an amendment agreement to the existing investment agreement with Emirates NBD Bank (P.J.S.C) and to consider convening an extraordinary general meeting of the bank (Key Developments).",
