      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-04-02T19:06:48.000Z",
      "title": "RBLBANK: Board And Leadership Moves Will Support Future Re Rating",
      "body": "Analysts have kept the price target for RBL Bank steady at ₹410, pointing to updated assumptions around revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E that balance each other out in their valuation work. What's in the News RBL Bank has scheduled a Board Meeting on Jan 17, 2026, to consider and approve its unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended Dec 31, 2025, subject to a limited review by the Joint Statutory Auditors (Key Developments).",
