      "title": "RBLBANK: Governance Changes And Lower Risk Assumptions Will Support Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have maintained the fair value for RBL Bank at ₹342.56 per share, while adjusting key assumptions such as a lower discount rate, more moderate revenue growth and profit margin expectations, and a higher future P/E multiple to reflect updated views on the bank’s risk and earnings profile. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for January 17, 2026 to consider and approve unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended December 31, 2025, subject to a limited review by joint statutory auditors (Board Meeting).",
