      "date": "2026-02-21T05:41:00.000Z",
      "title": "Rbl Bank Limited Announces Directorate Changes",
      "body": "RBL Bank Limited announced that Mr. Rajeev Ahuja, Executive Director of the Bank, has retired from the services of the Bank upon completion of his term and has accordingly ceased to be the Whole-time Director (designated as Executive Director) and Key Managerial Personnel of the Bank with effect from the close of business hours of February 20, 2026. Mr. Jaideep Iyer has assumed charge as a Whole-time Director (designated as Executive Director) and a Key Managerial Personnel of the Bank effective February 21, 2026. His term as approved by the Reserve Bank of India and Shareholders is for a period of three years i.e. with effect from February 21, 2026, till February 20, 2029. The Board of Directors of the Bank had approved the names of the KMP authorised under Regulation 30 (5) of the SEBI L",
